1
00:00:00,709 --> 00:00:03,003
What's with the tension?

2
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:04,747
Did I interrupt
something again?

3
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:08,508
What brings you here
this time?

4
00:00:08,508 --> 00:00:09,801
Come on, Ji-sung.

5
00:00:09,801 --> 00:00:12,429
Don't be so cold.

6
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:14,556
You don't mind if I
join the training, do you?

7
00:00:14,556 --> 00:00:16,141
Uh... I...

8
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:17,183
No.

9
00:00:17,583 --> 00:00:19,877
I can help.

10
00:00:20,205 --> 00:00:22,958
Wouldn't it be better
with a pro helping out?

11
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,650
So, still not
taking the offer?

12
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:34,311
Triple the pay
better conditions...

13
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:36,536
I told you I'm not interested.

14
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:37,871
Why?

15
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:41,291
You got a reason to stay here?

16
00:00:53,386 --> 00:00:55,555
Done already?

17
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:56,555
Yes.

18
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:59,809
You okay?
You don't look so good.

19
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:02,479
Jeong-min Lee

20
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:05,106
offered Ji-sung
a scouting deal.

21
00:01:05,106 --> 00:01:07,275
Oh, that...

22
00:01:07,275 --> 00:01:08,818
You knew?

23
00:01:09,069 --> 00:01:12,072
Yeah, but Ji-sung
turned it down.

24
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:14,574
Why would he do that?

25
00:01:14,574 --> 00:01:16,034
Well...

26
00:01:16,457 --> 00:01:19,460
maybe he feels
responsible for you?

27
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:23,625
See you tomorrow.

28
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,669
Responsible?
